{"cols": 100, "lines": [{"text": ""}, {"text": "  Should I write a longer poem about rain?"}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "\u273b Worked for 1s \u00b7 done 11:51 PM", "spans": [{"col": 0, "width": 1, "text": "\u273b", "fg": "#999999"}, {"col": 2, "width": 29, "text": "Worked for 1s \u00b7 done 11:51 PM", "fg": "#999999"}]}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "\u276f No. Instead tell me in one sentence what a haiku is, then ask if I want an example.", "spans": [{"col": 0, "width": 2, "text": "\u276f ", "fg": "#999999", "bg": "#373737"}, {"col": 2, "width": 83, "text": "No. Instead tell me in one sentence what a haiku is, then ask if I want an example.", "fg": "#ffffff", "bg": "#373737"}, {"col": 85, "width": 15, "text": "               ", "bg": "#373737"}]}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "\u23fa A haiku is a short Japanese poem of three lines, traditionally with five, seven, and five", "spans": [{"col": 0, "width": 1, "text": "\u23fa", "fg": "#ffffff"}]}, {"text": "  syllables, that captures a single moment of nature or season."}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "  Would you like an example?"}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "\u273b Baked for 0s \u00b7 done 11:52 PM", "spans": [{"col": 0, "width": 1, "text": "\u273b", "fg": "#999999"}, {"col": 2, "width": 28, "text": "Baked for 0s \u00b7 done 11:52 PM", "fg": "#999999"}]}, {"text": ""}, {"text": "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500", "spans": [{"col": 0, "width": 100, "text": "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u